    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Elegant Dark\nDesign HTML:                   <!doctype html>\\n                  <html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n                    <head>\\n                      <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n                      <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n                      <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n                      <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n                      <style>\\n                        body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n                        /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n                        .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n                        .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n                        .flex { display: flex; }\\n                        .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n                        .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n                      </style>\\n                    </head>\\n                    <body>\\n                      <div class=\\\"flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-gray-200 font-sans overflow-hidden\\\">\\n  <!-- Sidebar: Match History & Controls -->\\n  <div class=\\\"w-72 bg-[#121212] border-r border-white/10 flex flex-col\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"p-6 border-b border-white/10\\\">\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-cyan-400\\\">MR SHOOTER</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 uppercase tracking-widest\\\">Scoreboard Manager</p>\\n    </div>\\n    \\n    <div class=\\\"p-4\\\">\\n      <label class=\\\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500 font-bold mb-2 block\\\">Session History</label>\\n    